Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,A pharma truck leaves Mumbai\Nat 4 °C.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:04.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,The driver is entering\Na highway dead zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:08.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Offline-first — each check\Nis stamped with who and when.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:12.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Scan the AWB — the shipment's\Ntracking number.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.60,0:00:15.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Photograph the tamper seal —\NGPS, time and plate burned in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:18.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,The fridge fails: 8.9 °C.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:20.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Two minutes — then the\Ncontrol room is notified.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:23.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every call lands\Nin the audit trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:26.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Log the fix — who, when,\Nwhat was done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:29.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Back in signal —\Nthe captures sync one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:33.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,The receiver signs\Non the device.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:37.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,No "delivered" button —\Nthe e-POD closes itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:44.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,The client sees everything\Nthe driver captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:48.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,One tap — the full audit PDF.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:59.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,One Flutter codebase,\Nbuilt on your tracking data.
